Copyright © 2026 Delegance. All rights reserved.

## 1. Definitions

**1.1 "Software"** means the Alinery software components made available by
Delegance under this License, including the Client and the Execution Daemon,
together with their source code, documentation, and any Modifications.

**1.2 "Execution Daemon"** means the component of the Software that executes
Playbooks, including on a schedule or without an interactive user present,
and that records process logs and maintains the optimization loop.

**1.3 "Modification"** means any addition to, deletion from, or change to
the Software, including adaptations of the Software's interfaces.

**1.4 "Individual Use"** means a single natural person using the Software,
including the Execution Daemon, on hardware that person owns or controls,
for that person's own purposes. Individual Use expressly includes
non-commercial use, academic use, classroom and research use, and use by a
student, whether or not affiliated with an educational institution.

**1.5 "Shared Server Use"** means operating the Execution Daemon such that
it is used, directly or indirectly, by more than one natural person, or by
more than one legal entity, or by any employee, contractor, or agent of an
organization other than the operator as an individual.

**1.6 "Production Use"** means operating the Execution Daemon, whether or
not shared within the meaning of Section 1.5, on behalf of or within an
organization in connection with the organization's commercial activity,
including internal business processes, client work, and product
development.

**1.7 "Server License"** means a commercial license issued by Delegance
that authorizes Shared Server Use and/or Production Use of the Execution
Daemon under terms stated in that license.

